Nimbus maintains an official historic catalogue and data-sheet archive, establishing authoritative model provenance. Representative 1988-90 brokerage specifications consistently show approximately 9.20 x 3.20 m, single Volvo diesel shaft drive, aft cabin, shower and galley. Draft is reported from about 0.85 to 1.05 m, so individual-boat verification remains necessary.

